# State Machine

Model statuses that have a legal order, such as an order, with explicit transitions. Do not scatter status jumps across conditionals.

```ts
const orderTransitions = {
  pending: ["paid", "cancelled"],
  paid: ["shipped", "refunded"],
  shipped: ["delivered"],
} as const;

function canTransition(from: OrderStatus, to: OrderStatus) {
  return orderTransitions[from]?.includes(to) ?? false;
}
```
